<title>UK: M.L. Laboratories splits chairman/ceo role.</title>
<headline>M.L. Laboratories splits chairman/ceo role.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>M.L. Laboratories Plc said on Wednesday that chairman and chief executive Kevin Leech will split the combined role to concentrate on his duties as executive chairman.</p>
<p>Stuart Sim, currently deputy chief executive and finance director, will become chief executive and Peter Shennan is appointed finance director.</p>
<p>Shennan was principle, corporate finance, at Coopers &amp; Lybrand.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
